{%- comment -%} Daisy Maison Elf Arrival landing page — native personalisation, sibling-first offer, consistent twin-pack add-ons, clear selected states. {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="dm-lp">
<style>
  .dm-lp{--g:#1f4d3a;--r:#b3202e;--cream:#fbf7ef;--sel:#eef3e7;--bd:#d9d2c3;--ink:#2b2b2b;--mut:#5a5a5a;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 16px 48px;touch-action:manipulation}
  .dm-lp *,.dm-lp *:before,.dm-lp *:after{box-sizing:border-box}
  .dm-lp img{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
  .dm-lp h1{font-size:25px;line-height:1.15;color:var(--g);margin:0 0 8px;text-wrap:balance}
  .dm-lp h2{font-size:20px;color:var(--g);margin:0 0 12px;text-wrap:balance}
  .dm-lp .lp-grid{display:grid;gap:24px}
  @media(min-width:990px){.dm-lp .lp-grid{grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;align-items:start}.dm-lp .lp-buy{position:sticky;top:24px}}
  .dm-lp .lp-media-main{border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--bd);background:#fff}
  .dm-lp .lp-thumbs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
  .dm-lp .lp-thumbs button{padding:0;border:2px solid var(--bd);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;width:64px;height:64px;flex:0 0 auto}
  .dm-lp .lp-thumbs button[aria-current="true"]{border-color:var(--g);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--g)}
  .dm-lp .lp-thumbs button:focus-visible,.dm-lp input:focus-visible,.dm-lp .lp-cta:focus-visible,.dm-lp summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--g);outline-offset:2px}
  .dm-lp .lp-thumbs img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  .dm-lp .lp-eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--r);margin:0 0 4px}
  .dm-lp .lp-sub{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--mut);font-size:14px}
  .dm-lp .lp-trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 14px;margin:0 0 14px;padding:0;list-style:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--g)}
  .dm-lp fieldset{border:0;margin:0 0 14px;padding:0}
  .dm-lp legend{font-weight:800;color:var(--g);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px;padding:0}
  .dm-lp .lp-field{margin:0 0 8px}
  .dm-lp .lp-field label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px}
  .dm-lp .lp-field input{width:100%;min-height:46px;padding:10px 12px;border:1.5px solid var(--bd);border-radius:10px;font-size:16px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
  .dm-lp .lp-field.lp-err input{border-color:var(--r)}
  .dm-lp .lp-errmsg{display:none;color:var(--r);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-top:3px}
  .dm-lp .lp-field.lp-err .lp-errmsg{display:block}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer{border:2px dashed var(--g);border-radius:14px;background:#fff;padding:12px 14px;margin:0 0 14px;transition:background .15s,border-style .15s}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer.lp-sel{background:var(--sel);border-style:solid;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--g)}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer-chip{display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--g);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer-row input{width:22px;height:22px;accent-color:var(--g);flex:0 0 auto;margin:0}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer-row .lp-ck-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer-row .lp-ck-sub{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:var(--mut)}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer-row .lp-ck-price{margin-left:auto;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer-row .lp-ck-price strong{color:var(--g)}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer-row .lp-was{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--mut)}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer.lp-sel .lp-tick{display:inline}
  .dm-lp .lp-tick{display:none;color:var(--g);font-weight:800}
  .dm-lp .lp-offer-fields{margin-top:12px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px dashed var(--g)}
  .dm-lp .lp-check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1.5px solid var(--bd);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;padding:10px 12px;margin:0 0 6px;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .dm-lp .lp-check:hover{border-color:var(--g)}
  .dm-lp .lp-check.lp-sel{border-color:var(--g);background:var(--sel);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--g)}
  .dm-lp .lp-check input[type="checkbox"]{width:22px;height:22px;accent-color:var(--g);flex:0 0 auto;margin:0}
  .dm-lp .lp-check img{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover;flex:0 0 auto}
  .dm-lp .lp-check .lp-ck-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);min-width:0}
  .dm-lp .lp-check .lp-ck-sub{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:var(--mut)}
  .dm-lp .lp-check .lp-ck-price{margin-left:auto;font-weight:800;color:var(--g);white-space:nowrap}
  .dm-lp .lp-check.lp-sel .lp-ck-price:before{content:"✓ ";font-weight:800}
  .dm-lp .lp-qty{display:none;width:100%;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
  .dm-lp .lp-qty.lp-show{display:flex}
  .dm-lp .lp-chip{flex:1 1 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;border:1.5px solid var(--bd);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;background:#fff;text-align:center;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s}
  .dm-lp .lp-chip input{accent-color:var(--g);margin:0;width:16px;height:16px}
  .dm-lp .lp-chip .lp-save{color:var(--g);font-weight:800;font-size:12px}
  .dm-lp .lp-chip.lp-on{border-color:var(--g);background:var(--sel);color:var(--g);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--g)}
  .dm-lp .lp-bundlenote{display:none;margin:2px 0 8px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--sel);border:1px solid var(--g);color:var(--g);font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
  .dm-lp .lp-total{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin:12px 0 10px;font-size:16px}
  .dm-lp .lp-total strong{font-size:24px;color:var(--ink)}
  .dm-lp .lp-cta{width:100%;min-height:52px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--g);color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}
  .dm-lp .lp-cta:hover{background:#16382a}
  .dm-lp .lp-cta[disabled]{opacity:.7;cursor:default}
  .dm-lp .lp-formerr{display:none;margin:10px 0 0;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:#fdf0f0;border:1px solid var(--r);color:var(--r);font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
  .dm-lp .lp-reassure{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);padding-left:0;list-style:none}
  .dm-lp .lp-reassure li{margin:0 0 4px}
  .dm-lp .lp-section{margin:40px 0 0}
  .dm-lp .lp-steps{display:grid;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  @media(min-width:768px){.dm-lp .lp-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}}
  .dm-lp .lp-steps li{border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;padding:14px}
  .dm-lp .lp-steps .lp-n{display:inline-block;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--r);color:#fff;font-weight:800;text-align:center;line-height:28px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .dm-lp .lp-verse{border:2px dashed var(--r);border-radius:14px;background:var(--cream);padding:18px}
  .dm-lp .lp-verse p{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1.6}
  .dm-lp .lp-cols{display:grid;gap:20px}
  @media(min-width:768px){.dm-lp .lp-cols{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
  .dm-lp .lp-cols ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}
  .dm-lp .lp-cols li{margin:0 0 6px}
  .dm-lp details{border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:10px;background:#fff;padding:10px 12px;margin:0 0 8px}
  .dm-lp summary{font-weight:700;color:var(--g);cursor:pointer}
  .dm-lp details p{margin:8px 0 0}
  .dm-lp .lp-cross{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px}
  .dm-lp .lp-cross a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;transition:border-color .15s}
  .dm-lp .lp-cross a:hover{border-color:var(--g)}
  .dm-lp .lp-cross .lp-c-body{padding:10px 12px;font-size:13px}
  .dm-lp .lp-cross .lp-c-body strong{display:block;color:var(--g)}
  .dm-lp .lp-trustbar{margin:40px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--g);color:#fff;font-size:14px}
  .dm-lp .lp-trustbar a{color:var(--cream);font-weight:700}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.dm-lp *{transition:none!important}}
</style>

{%- assign m1 = product.media[0] -%}
{%- comment -%} Christmas Gift Wrap Kit add-on: read live from the product so price/id track admin; the row only renders while the kit is active + purchasable. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign dm_wrap = all_products['christmas-gift-wrap-kit'] -%}
{%- assign dm_wrap_v = dm_wrap.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
{%- assign dm_wrap_img = dm_wrap.images[1] | default: dm_wrap.featured_image -%}
{%- assign dm_wrap_live = false -%}
{%- if dm_wrap.available and dm_wrap_v.available and dm_wrap_img -%}{%- assign dm_wrap_live = true -%}{%- endif -%}
<div class="lp-grid">
  <div class="lp-media">
    <div class="lp-media-main">
      <img id="dm-main-img" src="{{ m1 | image_url: width: 1200 }}" width="1200" height="1200" alt="{{ m1.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
    <div class="lp-thumbs" role="group" aria-label="Product photos">
      {%- for media in product.media limit: 5 -%}
      <button type="button" data-full="{{ media | image_url: width: 1200 }}" aria-label="View photo {{ forloop.index }}" {% if forloop.first %}aria-current="true"{% endif %}>
        <img src="{{ media | image_url: width: 128 }}" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy">
      </button>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="lp-buy">
    <p class="lp-eyebrow">Daisy Maison Elf Postcard</p>
    <h1>The morning their elf arrives, holding a postcard with their name on it.</h1>
    <p class="lp-sub">A personalised acrylic arrival postcard for your family's Christmas elf. Hand-drawn in Blackpool, made to be found on the first morning of December.</p>
    <ul class="lp-trust">
      <li>✓ Free personalisation</li>
      <li>✓ 3&nbsp;mm acrylic, UV printed</li>
      <li>✓ Trustpilot Excellent</li>
    </ul>

    <form id="dm-elf-form" novalidate>
      <fieldset>
        <legend>Personalise the postcard</legend>
        <div class="lp-field" data-req>
          <label for="dm-child">Child's name, or names</label>
          <input id="dm-child" name="child" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="60" placeholder="Lottie &amp; Arlo…">
          <p class="lp-errmsg">Please add the name for the top of the postcard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-field" data-req>
          <label for="dm-elf">Your elf's name</label>
          <input id="dm-elf" name="elf" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="40" placeholder="Tinsel, Jingle, Pip…">
          <p class="lp-errmsg">Please add your elf's name for the signature.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-field" data-req>
          <label for="dm-addr">Family name and address, as you want it printed</label>
          <input id="dm-addr" name="addr" type="text" autocomplete="off" maxlength="120" placeholder="The Hammond Family, 14 Meadow Lane, Durham…">
          <p class="lp-errmsg">Please add the address for the left of the postcard.</p>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <div class="lp-offer" id="dm-offer-box">
        <span class="lp-offer-chip">Sibling offer</span>
        <label class="lp-offer-row"><input type="checkbox" id="dm-sib"><span class="lp-ck-name">Add a second postcard, one for each child <span class="lp-tick">✓ Added</span><span class="lp-ck-sub">Their own name, their own elf signature. No arguments on arrival morning.</span></span><span class="lp-ck-price"><strong>+£9.95</strong><span class="lp-was">usually £11.95</span></span></label>
        <div class="lp-offer-fields" id="dm-sib-fields" hidden>
          <div class="lp-field" data-req2>
            <label for="dm-child2">Second postcard: child's name</label>
            <input id="dm-child2" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="60" placeholder="Their brother or sister's name…">
            <p class="lp-errmsg">Please add the name for the second postcard.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-field" data-req2>
            <label for="dm-elf2">Second postcard: elf's name</label>
            <input id="dm-elf2" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="40" placeholder="Same elf, or their own…">
            <p class="lp-errmsg">Please add the elf's name for the second postcard.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-field" data-req2>
            <label for="dm-addr2">Second postcard: family name and address</label>
            <input id="dm-addr2" type="text" autocomplete="off" maxlength="120" placeholder="Usually the same address…">
            <p class="lp-errmsg">Please add the address for the second postcard.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <fieldset>
        <legend>Build the set</legend>

        <label class="lp-check" data-row="plush"><input type="checkbox" id="dm-add-plush"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0897/0017/2115/files/hf_20260903_122754_34134686-23c0-4059-92b7-aedfb87978ec.png?v=1788438813&amp;width=128" width="44" height="44" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="lp-ck-name">Plush Elf Friend<span class="lp-ck-sub">12" soft-bodied elf, slots through the postcard</span></span><span class="lp-ck-price" data-price-label="plush">+£7.95</span>
          <span class="lp-qty" data-qty="plush" role="radiogroup" aria-label="How many plush elves">
            <label class="lp-chip lp-on"><input type="radio" name="plushqty" value="1" checked>Just one · £7.95</label>
            <label class="lp-chip"><input type="radio" name="plushqty" value="2">One each · £13.95 <span class="lp-save">save £1.95</span></label>
          </span>
        </label>

        <label class="lp-check" data-row="pj"><input type="checkbox" id="dm-add-pj"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0897/0017/2115/files/hf_20260903_152443_1d242ff8-403c-41fc-82d0-b3e4d417a03f.png?v=1788449630&amp;width=128" width="44" height="44" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="lp-ck-name">Elf Pyjamas, red print<span class="lp-ck-sub">Bedtime on arrival night</span></span><span class="lp-ck-price" data-price-label="pj">+£7.95</span>
          <span class="lp-qty" data-qty="pj" role="radiogroup" aria-label="How many pyjama sets">
            <label class="lp-chip lp-on"><input type="radio" name="pjqty" value="1" checked>Just one · £7.95</label>
            <label class="lp-chip"><input type="radio" name="pjqty" value="2">One each · £13.95 <span class="lp-save">save £1.95</span></label>
          </span>
        </label>

        <label class="lp-check" data-row="sheets"><input type="checkbox" id="dm-add-sheets"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0897/0017/2115/files/hf_20260903_153243_90468dd8-ef7e-4b86-bff0-fa43ac5ffb55.png?v=1788449677&amp;width=128" width="44" height="44" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="lp-ck-name">Santa Report Sheets, 5 pack<span class="lp-ck-sub">Nice or naughty, filled in overnight. One pack covers both elves.</span></span><span class="lp-ck-price">+£4.95</span></label>

        {%- if dm_wrap_live -%}
        <label class="lp-check" data-row="wrap"><input type="checkbox" id="dm-add-wrap"><img src="{{ dm_wrap_img | image_url: width: 128 }}" width="44" height="44" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="lp-ck-name">Christmas Gift Wrap Kit<span class="lp-ck-sub">Kraft paper, red &amp; white twine, pine sprig and a gift tag. Sealed flat, ready to wrap it up.</span></span><span class="lp-ck-price" data-price-label="wrap">+£{{ dm_wrap_v.price | money_without_currency }}</span>
          <span class="lp-qty" data-qty="wrap" role="radiogroup" aria-label="How many gift wrap kits">
            <label class="lp-chip lp-on"><input type="radio" name="wrapqty" value="1" checked>Just one · £{{ dm_wrap_v.price | money_without_currency }}</label>
            <label class="lp-chip"><input type="radio" name="wrapqty" value="2">One each · £{{ dm_wrap_v.price | times: 1.5 | round | money_without_currency }} <span class="lp-save">2nd half price</span></label>
          </span>
        </label>
        {%- endif -%}

        <p class="lp-bundlenote" id="dm-bundle-note" role="status">Night Shift Set applied — pyjamas + report sheets for £9.95, saving £2.95.</p>
      </fieldset>

      <div class="lp-total"><span>Total</span> <strong id="dm-total" aria-live="polite">£11.95</strong></div>
      <button type="submit" class="lp-cta" id="dm-cta">Add to basket</button>
      <p class="lp-formerr" id="dm-form-err" role="alert"></p>
    </form>

    <ul class="lp-reassure">
      <li>🧝 Already have an elf? The slots fit most 12" soft-bodied elves, and the postcard stands on its own beside them.</li>
      <li>📦 Made to order in the UK. Dispatched tracked in 5 to 7 working days, express 2 to 3 at checkout.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="lp-section">
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol class="lp-steps">
    <li><span class="lp-n">1</span><strong>Personalise above.</strong> Child's name, your elf's name, and the address you want printed.</li>
    <li><span class="lp-n">2</span><strong>We print it in the UK.</strong> Made to order on 3&nbsp;mm acrylic with UV inks, then dispatched tracked.</li>
    <li><span class="lp-n">3</span><strong>Their elf arrives holding it.</strong> Slots for arms and legs mean the elf holds the postcard on its own.</li>
  </ol>
</div>

<div class="lp-section lp-verse">
  <p class="lp-eyebrow">What the postcard says</p>
  <p>Season's greetings, I'm here to play.<br>I'll be here watching you until Christmas Day.<br>I'll be taking note of all the nice things you do,<br>to report to Santa and his clever elves too.<br>Each morning you must search left and right,<br>to see what I was up to whilst your eyes were closed tight.<br>If you're good and as nice as can be,<br>you'll find your presents under the tree.<br><span style="color:#b3202e">Love, <em>your elf's name</em></span></p>
</div>

<div class="lp-section lp-cols">
  <div>
    <h2>Personalisation guide</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Names at the top:</strong> one child or several, for example "Lottie &amp; Arlo".</li>
      <li><strong>Your elf's name at the bottom:</strong> Tinsel, Jingle, Snowdrop, Pip, Twinkle, or whatever your family calls them.</li>
      <li><strong>Address on the left:</strong> family name and address, exactly as you would like it printed.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>Size and dispatch</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Approximately 10 x 16&nbsp;cm, 3&nbsp;mm acrylic, UV printed so it will not fade or tear.</li>
      <li>Arm and leg slots 1.7&nbsp;cm, sized for most 12" soft-bodied elf toys.</li>
      <li>Dispatched in 5 to 7 working days, express 2 to 3. Tracked Royal Mail or Yodel.</li>
      <li>Free UK delivery on orders over £50. Recyclable protective packaging.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="lp-section">
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <details><summary>Will it fit the elf we already have?</summary><p>The slots suit most 12" soft-bodied elves with slim arms and legs. If yours is larger, the postcard also stands on its own beside the elf.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Can two children share one postcard?</summary><p>Yes. Put both names at the top. For one each, tick the sibling offer above and the second postcard is £9.95.</p></details>
  <details><summary>When should I order for a 1 December arrival?</summary><p>Order by mid November and standard dispatch arrives comfortably before 1 December. After that, choose express dispatch at checkout.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Do you sell a girl elf?</summary><p>Our Plush Elf Friend is the classic red boy elf. The postcard slots fit most 12" girl elves too, so she is very welcome to hold it.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Can the verse be changed?</summary><p>The verse is part of the hand-drawn design and stays the same. The names and address are yours.</p></details>
</div>

